{"search_index": 0, "query": "Ghislaine Maxwell congressional testimony Congress Epstein subpoena", "backend": "agentcore", "num_results": 1, "results": [{"index": 0, "title": "When Does Ghislaine Maxwell Testify Before Congress And Will It Be Televised?", "url": "https://www.timesnownews.com/world/us/us-news/when-does-ghislaine-maxwell-testify-before-congress-and-will-it-be-televised-epstein-files-article-153573246", "snippet": "- When Does Ghislaine Maxwell Testify Before Congress And Will It Be Televised? - Authored by: Naman Trivedi - Updated Feb 7, 2026, 03:36 IST Ghislaine Maxwell is scheduled to testify before the House Oversight Committee on February 9 in a closed-door virtual deposition that will not be televised. Her testimony comes amid new revelations from the 2026 Epstein files release detailing emails, surveillance footage, and previously undisclosed correspondence tied to high-profile figures. 

