{"search_index": 0, "query": "Ornn H200 Index current value Ornnai dashboard", "backend": "agentcore", "num_results": 4, "results": [{"index": 0, "title": "Financial Products for Compute", "url": "https://ornn.com/", "snippet": "Computing Power Coal, Iron, Cotton Computing Power Computing Power The OCPI. The reference price for compute. We also support OCPI-H200, OCPI-B200, OCPI-RTX5090, and more... The OCPI tracks live traded spot prices for GPU compute across major hardware types: H100, H200, B200, B300, and more. It's the foundation for pricing, hedging, and settlement across the compute derivatives market. "}, {"index": 1, "title": "Financial Products for AI Infrastructure", "url": "https://www.ornnai.com/", "snippet": "Computing Power Coal, Iron, Cotton Oil & Gas Computing Power Computing Power The OCPI. The reference price for compute. We also support OCPI-H200, OCPI-B200, OCPI-RTX5090, and more... The OCPI tracks live traded spot prices for GPU compute across major hardware types: H100, H200, B200, RTX 5090, and more. It's the foundation for pricing, hedging, and settlement across the compute derivatives market. "}, {"index": 2, "title": "Financial Products for AI Infrastructure", "url": "https://www.ornnai.com/old-home", "snippet": "Computing Power Coal, Iron, Cotton Oil & Gas Computing Power Computing Power The OCPI. The reference price for compute. We also support OCPI-H200, OCPI-B200, OCPI-RTX5090, and more... The OCPI tracks live traded spot prices for GPU compute across major hardware types: H100, H200, B200, RTX 5090, and more. It's the foundation for pricing, hedging, and settlement across the compute derivatives market. "}, {"index": 3, "title": "Ornn Compute Price Index Added to Bloomberg Terminal", "url": "https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/ornn-compute-price-index-added-to-bloomberg-terminal-302732184.html", "snippet": "- Ornn Compute Price Index Added to Bloomberg Terminal - --- - News provided by Apr 02, 2026, 08:05 ET - --- NEW YORK, April 2, 2026 /PRNewswire/ -- Ornn AI Inc., the company building the financial infrastructure to power the age of AI, today announced that the Ornn Compute Price Index (OCPI) is now available on the Bloomberg Terminal, expanding institutional access to standardized GPU pricing. The publication coincides with OCPI reaching six months as a live index, establishing the first sustained benchmark tracking how AI compute pricing has behaved through a period of heavy capital deployment and heightened scrutiny of AI economics. 

To address this, OCPI reflects negotiated transaction levels between data centers and compute buyers. The index currently tracks rental pricing for major GPU models including Nvidia H100, A100, H200, B200, and RTX class GPUs, with pricing normalized across hardware configuration, provider, and deployment context. 

